    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I saw your reply here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/689#issuecomment-1939509494\r\n\r\nand I also noticed this line in your configuration:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/4a8868a3aa082a18ed9c277c1c0354fd95a2566d/init.lua#L433\r\n\r\nIf I copy your configuration, and open markdown file, Neovim prompts me with `E5108: Error executing lua: vim/_editor.lua:0: nvim_exec2(): Vim:E492: Not an editor command: MarkdownPreview.`\r\n\r\nDoes this mean that all plugins using `BufEnter` autocmds need to be included in `MiniDeps.now`?",
    "closed_at": "2024-12-04T09:26:49Z",
