    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "a workaround is:\r\n\r\n```\r\nMiniDeps.later(function()\r\n\r\nvim.api.nvim_exec_autocmds(\r\n\t{\r\n\t\t\"BufEnter\",\r\n\t},\r\n\t{})\r\n\r\nend)\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut this will execute `BufEnter` autocmds in `MiniDeps.now` twice, which will cause side effetcs",
